OL,3,ASharp objects found in Halloween sweets
OL,4,Ain three European nations
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeedles and other sharp metal objects
OL,7,Fhave been found in sweets handed out
OL,8,Fover Halloween in Germany, Austria and
OL,9,FHungary, prompting police to issue
OL,10,Fwarnings to parents to check what their
OL,11,Fchildren have been given.
OL,13,FPolice in a number of German states
OL,14,Fhave reported cases, from Bavaria in
OL,15,Fthe south-east to Lower Saxony in the
OL,16,Fnorth.
OL,18,FA girl aged nine hurt her tongue while
OL,19,Feating a chocolate bar in Bremervorde,
OL,20,Fwest of Hamburg. A 5cm-long (2in) pin
OL,21,Fwas then found inside it.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
