OL,3,ASharp objects found in Halloween sweets
OL,4,Ain three European nations
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, police in Hungary have
OL,7,Flaunched a criminal investigation after
OL,8,Fnails, screws and pieces of wire were
OL,9,Ffound in sweets handed out to children
OL,10,Fwho had been trick-or-treating in and
OL,11,Faround the town of GyomrEQ, to the east
OL,12,Fof Budapest.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
